----

== Template Documentation ==
This template is intended to be used after importing the [[w:c:dev:ActivityFeedMimic|ActivityFeedMimic]] stylesheet. It uses the native [[Special:RecentChanges]] in it's embbeded-in-page version, and lets the imported stylesheet to give it a simplified look, similar to the look of the depreceated <code><nowiki><activityfeed /></nowiki></code> tag.


; Simple Usage
: <pre>{{ActivityFeed}}</pre>

Output:
{{ActivityFeed|limit=3}}

; Advanced Usage
: The template can be supplied with a few parameters
{| class="article-table" cell-spacing="10"
! Parameter !! Effect !! style="width:50%;" | Default value
|-
! limit
| The number of entries to list || 10
|-
! size
| Same as '''limit''' (provided for compatability with <code><nowiki><activityfeed size="..." /></nowiki></code>) || 10
|-
! namespace
| List of namespace numbers to show, sepearated by a semicolon || 0;1;2;3;6;10;110;500 <br /><br /> (which means '''Main, Talk, User, User&nbsp;talk, File, Template, Forum, User&nbsp;blog''')
|-
! onlylast
| If set to '''true''', shows only the last edit of each page. <br /><br /> This will prevent multiple edits of the same page from taking up the feed (Grouped edits are not supported by this stylesheet) || false
|}


; Other Options
: The local copy of the template may be edited to fit the community needs, but be careful not to break it.

